</media></para></solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1516426"><problem id="fs-id1321944">
<media id="fs-id2263429" alt="An image of a table with 8 columns and 5 rows. The cells in the first row and first column are shaded darker than the other cells. The cells not in the first row or column are all null. The first row has the values “+; 6; 7; 8; 9”. The first column has the values “+; 3; 4; 5; 6; 7; 8; 9”.">
